pbwinput 1
# The title sequence for the oracle comparison (port/tools/oracle/README.md, "The title sequence"; oracle.py title and
# title-check): power-on through the boot screens and the Game Freak logo to the opening, the title, and START to the
# start menu. On game frames, so that each press reaches both programs on the same pass of the game's main loop: the
# DS's start-up, its loading and its movies, which run on a clock, take it more frames than the port to get anywhere.
version w2_us
# A press in the opening, which skips it to the title on both: the pass during which GFL's frame count is 1100 reads it,
# and the title starts at count 1115 on both
1100 START
1101 -
# The title hides its layers after 1,740 of its frames (count 2877) and shows the 3D on the top screen; START brings
# them back
3000 START
3001 -
# START leaves for the start menu, which shows from count 3245 on the port and 3246 on the oracle (its cry ends a pass
# later there: the README's known differences)
3100 START
3101 -
